ials":["رخام كالاكاتا إيطالي أصلي مع معالجة النانو المقاومة للسوائل","خشب بلوط أوروبي مدخن (Smoked European Oak)","شاسيه فولاذي مجلفن عالي المقاومة"],"materialsEn":["Sealed Nano-treated Italian Calacatta Marble","Smoked European Oak Veneer & Solid Edges","Heavy-duty Structural Galvanized Steel Truss"],"finishes":["رخام كالاكاتا مصقول مع حماية نانو","بلوط مدخن غير لامع (Matte Oak)"],"finishesEn":["Polished Calacatta Marble","Matte Smoked Oak Polyurethane"],"featuresAr":["تتسع لـ 20 إلى 24 مقعد تنفيذي براحة تامة","6 وحدات اتصال مستقلة مزودة بـ HDMI, Type-C, ومآخذ كهربائية دولية","إمكانية تخصيص الطول حتى 12 متراً حسب مقاسات قاعة العميل"],"featuresEn":["Comfortably seats 20 to 24 executive members","6 concealed motorized multimedia pop-up hubs with universal power and USB-C","Modular fabrication scalable up to 12 meters"],"featured":true,"published":true,"leadTimeWeeks":5,"customizable":true},"locale":"ar","height":"h-[460px] sm:h-[540px] lg:h-[580px]"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-3 gap-3","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"relative aspect-[16/10] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-primary-950 border border-border shadow-sm","children":[["$","$L18",null,{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744173-8e7e53415bb0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","alt":"Product variant","fill":true,"className":"object-cover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pointer-events-none select-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden z-10 ","style":{"opacity":0.2},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"transform -rotate-12 border-2 border-white/40 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-black/10 backdrop-blur-[2px] flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-8 h-8","viewBox":"0 0 64 64","fill":"none","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":"6","y":"6","width":"52","height":"52","rx":"8","stroke":"#b9c2cc","strokeWidth":"2"}],["$","path",null,{"d":"M18 42V25L27 34L32 29L37 34L46 25V42","stroke":"#b9c2cc","strokeWidth":"2.5"}],["$","circle",